00:18:41.053 --> 00:18:42.888
Like,
I don't even have my nails done right now.

00:18:42.888 --> 00:18:45.691
Like, I'mma get my nails done before presser.

00:18:45.691 --> 00:18:46.725
Yeah, coz I normally got—

00:18:46.725 --> 00:18:49.294
