I was like, "These are f--king clean."

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:01.773
But, yeah.

00:19:01.773 --> 00:19:05.711
So, um, for me, I just,
I don't care what people think of me.

00:19:05.711 --> 00:19:08.981
Even when I was doing "The Pivot"
