00:37:12.330 --> 00:37:17.335
Cuz I know you say you let it go,
but mentally, how do you prepare?

00:37:17.335 --> 00:37:21.472
- Like I said, a lot of internal work
I've done over the years is just,

00:37:22.440 --> 00:37:24.342
it gives
me experience to be able to do that.

00:37:24.342 --> 00:37:26.277
Again, I'm not reacting to his probes.

00:37:26.277 --> 00:37:28.746
He's been trying so hard to probe me.

00:37:29.080 --> 00:37:30.414
I'm like, eh.

00:37:31.315 --> 00:37:32.817
Try harder.
- Yeah.
- You know?

00:37:32.817 --> 00:37:35.386
But then again, when it's time to work,
I know what I do.

00:37:35.386 --> 00:37:37.588
When I get busy, I get busy.
- Mmhmm.

00:37:37.588 --> 00:37:39.523
But right now, I'm like,
he's got bragging rights.

00:37:39.523 --> 00:37:41.292
He can talk all the shit he wants.

00:37:41.292 --> 00:37:42.660
I don't even have to try
and intimidate him.

00:37:42.660 --> 00:37:44.061
He's not very,

00:37:44.061 --> 00:37:45.863
it doesn't work on him. So same with me.

00:37:45.863 --> 00:37:47.665
I don't know
if he's going to try and intimidate me.

00:37:47.665 --> 00:37:47.832
Good luck.

00:37:47.832 --> 00:37:51.535
This doesn't work on me.
- Mmhmm.
- But I hope

00:37:52.370 --> 00:37:54.472
he thinks he's gonna walk in there
and walk through me.

00:37:54.872 --> 00:37:58.342
I hope he thinks that cuz
he's going to be in for a rude awakening.

00:37:58.576 --> 00:37:59.944
But again, maybe not.

00:37:59.944 --> 00:38:02.913
Maybe I might just fucking,
I don't know, run around and

00:38:03.381 --> 00:38:07.118
and then try and escape him
and maybe jump out of the cage.

00:38:07.118 --> 00:38:08.452
Who knows? But hey, stay true.

00:38:08.452 --> 00:38:10.721
That's why you got to watch the fight.
You'll see.
- Yes.

00:38:11.088 --> 00:38:11.656
So, OK.

