00:38:18.329 --> 00:38:23.000
- Yes. Well, we had, you were the first.
We had Jake Paul.

00:38:23.334 --> 00:38:26.537
- Oh, nah, he does boxing. That's my dog, though.
- Yes.
- That's my dog.

00:38:27.571 --> 00:38:28.572
